{"unit_id":"Kr-ATG__dsh-chat-plus#card-zh","repo":"Kr-ATG/dsh-chat-plus","commit":"9bf716af47a8ce547686a48543a126e819f794de","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chat-plus 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的对话体验与工作台扩展，通过 Cordis 插件注入客户端界面和宿主服务。它在对话中加入 Seeker 执行视图、思考与工具活动展示、HTML 和交互卡片、截图及文件预览，并提供记忆、技能、用量、画廊、档案、邮箱和供应商等工作台。用户可用它查看执行进展、管理工作区记忆与技能、浏览会话产物并配置模型相关能力。基础对话增强不要求单独账号；需要外部模型或搜索服务的部分按所选服务配置相应凭据。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-30","src/client/index.ts:164-177","src/host.ts:282-286","src/triad/host.ts:80-112"]}
{"unit_id":"Kr-ATG__dsh-chat-plus#card-en","repo":"Kr-ATG/dsh-chat-plus","commit":"9bf716af47a8ce547686a48543a126e819f794de","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-chat-plus extends the DSH web client with an activity view, interactive cards, screenshots, and previews. Workbenches cover memory, skills, usage, galleries, mail, profiles, and provider settings. Follow agent work and manage session tools; external model or search services may need credentials.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-30","src/client/index.ts:164-177","src/host.ts:282-286","src/triad/host.ts:80-112"]}
